@startuml
state Unregistered {
  [*] -> Unregistered
}
state Registered
state WatchingVideo
state UploadingVideo
state BrowsingLikes
state InDiscussion

Unregistered --> Registered : Create Account

Registered --> WatchingVideo : Start Watching
Registered --> UploadingVideo : Upload Request
Registered --> BrowsingLikes : View Saved
Registered --> InDiscussion : Enter Discussion

WatchingVideo --> BrowsingLikes : Save to Likes

BrowsingLikes --> WatchingVideo : View Video

UploadingVideo --> Registered : Upload Complete

InDiscussion --> Registered : Exit Discussion

WatchingVideo --> [*] : Logout/Close App
@enduml
